# stack.layermap - synthetic FOUNDRY GDS layer map (NDA-clean, generic names).
#
# Standard foundry layer-map form:  <layerName> <purpose> <gdsLayer> <gdsDatatype>
# The numbers are deliberately NON-COMPACT and use NON-ZERO datatypes, so a
# compact 1..N / datatype-0 fallback can never coincidentally match them.
# This is the single source of truth for both the foundry GDS fixture and the
# Magic bridge tech, mirroring how a real PDK ships one map both tools consume.
#
met1  drawing  68  20
met2  drawing  69  20
met3  drawing  70  20
via1  drawing  66  44
via2  drawing  67  44
